    "Create a new ACP session in the editor and send a prompt. Lumi runs the turn and streams updates back to the editor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a new ACP session in the editor and send a prompt. Lumi runs the turn and streams updates back to the editor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在编辑器中创建新的 ACP 会话并发送提示。Lumi 会执行回合并将更新流式回编辑器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在編輯器中建立新的 ACP 會話並發送提示。Lumi 會執行回合並將更新串流回編輯器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在編輯器中建立新的 ACP 會話並發送提示。Lumi 會執行回合並將更新串流回編輯器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在編輯器中建立新的 ACP 會話並發送提示。Lumi 會執行回合並將更新串流回編輯器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In any editor with Agent Client Protocol support, set the agent command to the path above. When the embedded agent ships inside Lumi.app, use /Applications/Lumi.app/Contents/MacOS/lumi-acp.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In any editor with Agent Client Protocol support, set the agent command to the path above. When the embedded agent ships inside Lumi.app, use /Applications/Lumi.app/Contents/MacOS/lumi-acp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何支持 Agent Client Protocol 的编辑器中，将 agent 命令设为上述路径。当 Lumi.app 内嵌 agent 正式发布后，请改用 /Applications/Lumi.app/Contents/MacOS/lumi-acp。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何支援 Agent Client Protocol 的編輯器中，將 agent 指令設為上述路徑。當 Lumi.app 內嵌 agent 正式發佈後，請改用 /Applications/Lumi.app/Contents/MacOS/lumi-acp。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何支援 Agent Client Protocol 的編輯器中，將 agent 指令設為上述路徑。當 Lumi.app 內嵌 agent 正式發佈後，請改用 /Applications/Lumi.app/Contents/MacOS/lumi-acp。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何支援 Agent Client Protocol 的編輯器中，將 agent 指令設為上述路徑。當 Lumi.app 內嵌 agent 正式發佈後，請改用 /Applications/Lumi.app/Contents/MacOS/lumi-acp。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
